# Cloudflare Pages headers for blog.iankitkumar.in
#
# One rule per path. Pages applies every rule whose path matches and
# concatenates a header that two rules both set, so a path may not
# appear twice — and a rule that sets Cache-Control replaces Pages'
# own default for that path rather than adding to it.
#
# The catch-all therefore carries only the security headers: Pages
# already serves HTML with `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, and
# the asset rules below replace that with a long immutable policy.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/og/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/feed.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=1800
